{"server":"cn","storyId":"act36side_level_act36side_02_beg","groupId":"act36side","stageId":"act36side_02","title":"雨林解毒炖汤","storyCode":"DT-2","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"6c97ae536eb866f2a7b1f5f9d64c0d10a6b7da94fd8bd9ca2e76436a0f41bf2e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"小队几人原本想要找部落的智者大祭司求助，却没想到，被新世界的种种消息塞满了脑袋、正头脑发昏的玛露西尔不慎吃下了毒果，部落因此陷入了混乱。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱欧斯，快跟上啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快来看这颗蘑菇！迷宫里最大的走路菇都没有这么大吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是走路菇长得这么大该有多威风啊......一会儿的午饭可以考虑吃它吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你小心一点啊，美食指南里说丛林里面的蘑菇多多少少都有一些毒性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如吃了之后会全身起疹子，会导致血液凝固，会不断呕吐直到把内脏都吐出来之类的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不敢想象写下这本指南的人都经历了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫只跟着兽人学了分辨迷宫蘑菇的方法，这些没见过的还是不要轻易尝试了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这边有动物把这种厚厚的蘑菇当作食物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，如果只有一两种动物在吃，那么这种植物对大部分动物可能都有毒性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"换句话说，如果很多动物都在吃，那么它才有可能是没有毒性的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（低沉的咆哮）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么声音？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（尖锐的蜂鸣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么东西往这边飞来了！大家小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯小队","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（东敲敲，西敲敲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯！刚才那一发炸得真够狠的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好找了没人的测试场地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"膛压，爆表。温度，爆表。装载量，也爆表！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来还是要劲够大才好使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来就是最后调试一下刚才的配置，松松皮带，紧紧螺丝就完成了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要不出什么意外，我的最新力作“无敌的酷东西”就可以开出去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，得赶紧先把易爆品都拆掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"远离明火，安全第一~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（东敲敲，西敲敲）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......那边有东西一直在爆炸......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛露西尔，你没事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我还好！只是，有点头晕......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（低沉的咆哮）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么还有......！小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是魔像吗？还是石像鬼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看我用魔法——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"轰隆——！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司，大祭司，你在这里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么声音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呜哇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鳄鱼！还是长着鳄鱼头的兽人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鳄鱼头兽人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？兽人是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还说话了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鳄鱼头兽人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"我会说话很奇怪吗？——喂，那边那两个杜林，你们是从地下刚爬上来的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“杜林”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喊我们吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鳄鱼头兽人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"除了你们两个矮个子还有谁长得像杜林？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说，在他眼里，我和齐尔查克是同一个种族？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里没有“半身人”这样的说法吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鳄鱼头兽人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么乱七八糟的，你们这群人指定是有点毛病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鳄鱼头兽人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你们有没有在这里见过我们的大祭司？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鳄鱼头兽人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"一个老头，比我矮点，戴个眼镜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他为什么会出现在这么危险的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鳄鱼头兽人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司的想法一向很神秘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们一路过来，没见过这样的老者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鳄鱼头兽人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司的行踪确实也很神秘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鳄鱼头兽人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"既然这样，我还是回部落里去好了，反正每次出来找他都是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鳄鱼头兽人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"再见，奇怪的游客！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！请问，你听说过罗德岛吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鳄鱼头兽人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧，你们算是走运又有点不走运。因为我好像听过，又好像没听过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鳄鱼头兽人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"但我肯定，部落里有人知道这个什么岛在哪里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鳄鱼头兽人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"但是这个人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会就是大祭司吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鳄鱼头兽人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"你猜对了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鳄鱼头兽人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"这样吧，你们和我回部落里，一般我们出去找大祭司，总会找不到，但大祭司过一会自己也就回来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聪明的鳄鱼头兽人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说，你们之前在一座岛上，上面有个大迷宫，你们走着走着就到这里来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多就是这样，您知道些什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聪明的鳄鱼头兽人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......岛是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？就是......海上的陆地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聪明的鳄鱼头兽人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"海是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......就是有很多水的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聪明的鳄鱼头兽人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是湖吗？你说话还挺怪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，因为这里是内陆吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聪明的鳄鱼头兽人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"是你的问题太奇怪了！我从没听过什么海啊，岛啊，叫梅里尼的村子啊，你们该不会是被人一尾巴从泰拉的另一边扫过来的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"泰拉......是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聪明的鳄鱼头兽人","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"就是这里啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"玛露西尔试图从眼前的鳄鱼人的眼神中找到他在耍自己的痕迹。\n可惜，在那直率的眼神中，只有“这人该不会是个傻子吧？”这样一个信息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之就是，这群鳄......阿达克利斯里说得上话的是大祭司，玛露西尔刚刚炸坏的魔像就是他的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"机甲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"“无敌的酷东西”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们弄坏了他的“机甲”，他会愿意帮我们找罗德岛吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"没有关系，就算没有你们，那台机甲终究也会爆炸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"就没有不爆炸的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聪明的阿达克利斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司很随和的，只要等他回来跟他说明情况，想必他不会怪罪你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聪明的阿达克利斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司也很仗义，看到你们在这里迷路，他绝对不会见死不救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聪明的阿达克利斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是我们的大祭司！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽是这么说，但我们也要想个办法赔礼道歉才好......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聪明的阿达克利斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"不用在意啦——什么味道这么香，今天轮到谁做饭来着？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"是那个大胡子杜林在做饭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"泰拉、阿卡胡拉、活画、迷宫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......不行，完全理不出头绪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔法在这里也可以使用，这就说明在法则上是有共通之处的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法琳，要是你还在的话，我一定会像莱欧斯那样，对正在发生的这一切兴致勃勃吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，真想念我们一起在学校学习的日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，这些小鸟吃的这个果子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和那时候法琳给我吃的果子好像......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"好香啊，杜林做饭的手艺也这么好？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫不是杜林......唉，就当老夫是杜林吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"快叫兄弟们都来尝尝大胡子杜林的手艺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你们刚才说要去找大祭司？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我们想要向他请教一些问题。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"也对，大祭司是这里最聪明的人，但要见他没那么容易。要是他想见你们，你们就能见到他；要是他不愿意，你们是一定见不到他的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这倒是很符合智者的做派......那怎么样才能让他想见我们呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......祖玛玛大姐吩咐过，要是我们想借用大祭司的智慧，就得搞出点热闹的动静！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"热闹的动静......一顿大餐算吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没意见，问问玛露西尔的想法吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说起来，玛露西尔呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她还没回来吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶的炎龙，把法琳还给我！！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
